# Comet Crawler (2/3 lifelink) cast on turn 1 with three Moxen. On turn 3 it attacks and Bot1 sacrifices Mox Pearl (an artifact;
# the Crawler itself is not offered, "another"): it is 4/3 until end of turn and deals 4 with lifelink (Bot2 16, Bot1 24). On
# turn 5 Bot1 declines, nothing is sacrificed and it is 2/3 again: 2 more damage (Bot2 14, Bot1 26).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Comet Crawler
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Comet Crawler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Comet Crawler > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Comet Crawler)
Bot1.Choose(Mox Pearl)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Comet Crawler.Power = 4
? Bot1.Battlefield.Comet Crawler.Toughness = 3
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 16
? Bot1.Life = 24
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl = (absent)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Comet Crawler > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Bot1.Life = 26
Bot1.Battlefield.Comet Crawler.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = false
